WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:09.252
Everything you pay for is in one place. In this video, you’ll see your plan, add users, find your invoices, and buy extra AI credits.

2
00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:18.632
In the Admin console, open Subscription, under Billing. It shows your plan and what it includes, your next payment, and the card it’s paid with.

3
00:00:19.067 --> 00:00:26.448
You pay per user. Here, eight users are paid for, and seven are active. To make room for more people, click Add users.

4
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:34.623
Choose how many. You’re charged only for the rest of this billing period, and the new users are ready as soon as the payment goes through.

5
00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:45.200
Change plan compares Basic, Advance and Premium, and the AI credits each includes. Moving up applies right away. A cheaper plan starts at your next renewal.

6
00:00:45.633 --> 00:00:50.263
Invoices lists every invoice. View one, or download it as a PDF.

7
00:00:50.700 --> 00:01:00.172
Credit packs are for AI. Each person gets credits with your plan every month. When someone runs out, they use extra credits from a pack, shared by everyone.

8
00:01:00.633 --> 00:01:08.825
Bigger packs cost less per credit. Extra credits are for the month you buy them in. Every purchase, with its receipt, is listed below.

9
00:01:09.267 --> 00:01:13.512
All payments go through Stripe, so your card details never reach Worklynq.

10
00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:26.015
That’s plans and billing. Next in the Admin console series: how AI credits are used, and keeping an eye on them. You’ll find every guide at worklynq.com/docs.

